    "license": "MIT (upstream)",
    "local_path": "skills/survey-data-processing",
    "correction": "不把 60 秒、90% 直线作答或一次注意力题失败作为通用删除门槛。上游均值/和分代码没有充分限制有效题数，不能原样使用。上游所谓 pyreadstat 写出 .rds 不适用；R 可用 saveRDS，跨软件可用 CSV 加代码本。"
  },
  {
    "name": "power-analysis-guide",
    "kind": "adapted-upstream",
    "source": "https://github.com/wentorai/research-plugins/blob/bf44b3cd617fa94c8a1b254c5d1987142ca3d631/skills/analysis/statistics/power-analysis-guide/SKILL.md",
