    "license": "MIT (upstream)",
    "local_path": "skills/power-analysis-guide",
    "correction": "不套用中等效应或统一加 10–20%。小规模预测试不能稳定估计所有功效参数。复杂抽样的有效样本量近似不能替代针对实际设计的计算；功效足够不证明样本代表性。"
  },
  {
    "name": "missing-data-handling",
    "kind": "adapted-upstream",
    "source": "https://github.com/wentorai/research-plugins/blob/bf44b3cd617fa94c8a1b254c5d1987142ca3d631/skills/analysis/wrangling/missing-data-handling/SKILL.md",
    "upstream_commit": "bf44b3cd617fa94c8a1b254c5d1987142ca3d631",
    "upstream_sha256": "745af38ff84905ca4cbe3643cfe56745808a370ae904c403c4665e8cfd7093e6",
    "entry_sha256": "a8ce4cf1c09c847a98f4b1cd69df44d21b8c8264d132374e44557afcb8b5155a",
    "license": "MIT (upstream)",
    "local_path": "skills/missing-data-handling",
    "correction": "上游逐个 t 检验不是 Little 的 MCAR 检验；不显著不能确立 MCAR，观测数据通常无法区分 MAR 和 MNAR。单次均值插补不能恢复推断不确定性；结构性跳题不默认插补。上游 pooling 示例未实现其注释所称的完整 Barnard–Rubin 小样本修正。"
  },
  {
    "name": "hypothesis-testing-guide",
    "kind": "adapted-upstream",
    "source": "https://github.com/wentorai/research-plugins/blob/bf44b3cd617fa94c8a1b254c5d1987142ca3d631/skills/analysis/statistics/hypothesis-testing-guide/SKILL.md",
